WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:04.157
Organizations need consistent ways to manage security risk.

00:00:04.157 --> 00:00:08.475
NIST SP 800-53 was created to provide a structured approach to selecting and implementing

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.160
security and privacy controls.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.760
Instead of inventing security programs from scratch,

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.080
organizations can use an established framework to identify safeguards,

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.660
document responsibilities, and improve governance.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.335
The catalog helps different teams use a common language.

00:00:21.335 --> 00:00:24.150
Security leaders, engineers, assessors, system owners,

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:27.078
and managers can discuss controls using shared terminology.

00:00:27.078 --> 00:00:29.320
SP 800-53 does not make risk disappear.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.000
It gives organizations a disciplined way to reason about risk, choose safeguards,

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.600
and document how those safeguards are managed.
